    {
      "text": "large and mighty man, highly favored of the Lord, Ether 1:34. asks the Lord not to confound language, Ether 1:34–37. is promised choice land, Ether 1:38–42 (2:7). posterity to be great nation, Ether 1:43. is visited and led by the Lord, Ether 2:4–5. is chastened by the Lord, repents, and is forgiven, Ether 2:14–15. is instructed to build barges, Ether 2:16. melts stones for light in barges, Ether 3:1. sees finger of the Lord, Ether 3:6, 19 (12:20). sees, converses with Christ because of great faith, Ether 3:13–4:1. the Lord could not withhold anything from brother of Jared because of faith, Ether 3:20, 26 (12:21). told to write, then seal up record, Ether 3:22, 27–28. is given Urim and Thummim, Ether 3:23, 28. is shown all inhabitants of earth, past, present, and future, Ether 3:25. writings not to come forth before Christ’s Resurrection, Ether 4:1. puts stones in vessels for light, Ether 6:2. sings praises to the Lord, Ether 6:9. begets 22 sons and daughters, Ether 6:15, 20. warns against having kings, Ether 6:23. sons refuse to be king, Ether 6:25–26. dies, Ether 6:29. warnings of captivity are fulfilled, Ether 7:5. mighty in writing, Ether 12:24. caused mountain Zerin to be removed, Ether 12:30.",
